sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Admin
    participant B as Browser (/admin)
    participant W as Worker
    participant D as D1

    A->>B: Email + password
    B->>W: POST /api/admin/login
    W->>D: rate limit (8 per 15 min)
    W->>D: SELECT admin by email
    W->>W: PBKDF2-SHA256 verify (100k iterations, constant-time compare)
    alt wrong email or password
        W-->>B: 401 (same message and timing either way)
    end
    W->>W: token = 256-bit random
    W->>D: INSERT sessions (sha256(token), expires +7 days)
    W-->>B: Set-Cookie np_session (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Strict)
    B->>W: GET /api/admin/stats (cookie sent automatically)
    W->>D: JOIN sessions/admins WHERE token_hash AND not expired
    W-->>B: 200 data
    Note over W,D: Daily cron at 00:00 UTC deletes expired sessions and old rate-limit rows
